	"Description": "Designed this to help those mod makers who add lots of crops and trees to the game, also a great challenge for expert players who just love a really large greenhouse.\n<br />\n<br />(assuming i counted correctly) this greenhouse features:\n<br />(147) tree plots\n<br />(78) 5x5 crop plots\n<br />(28) crop plots of various sizes\n<br />water features that you can fill your watering can at\n<br />\n<br />I highly suggest using the Tractor mod\n<br />\n<br />I used Json More Trees, and Json Fruits and Veggies to fill the greenhouse in the screenshot.\n<br />\n<br />*To use the upgraded sprinkler layout download and unzip the file, take the greenhouse.tbin and put it in the asset folder.\n<br />\n<br />*To use the 5x5 only layout download and unzip the file place in your mod folder.\n<br />\n<br />Remember you can only\u00A0 use ONE layout at a time.",
